# Growlanser (PS1) text table: 16-bit little-endian code = glyph index in the EXE font
# (SLPS_023.80 file 0xE85C8, RAM 0x800F7DC8, 12x12 1bpp, 18 bytes/glyph). Built from tools/fontmatch.py
# (MS Gothic 12px pixel match: 1859 exact) plus hand checks. Codes absent here decode as [XXXX].
# Unverified/odd glyphs left out: 0107-0117 item icons, 028B-028E condensed "pendant", 0298 letter icon,
# 02A4 scroll/letter icon, 01BE flourish after ～, 01C2/0793 blank. Buttons: 03AD=○ 0571=□ 0643=△ 0644=✕ (✕ because
# 0651 is the text ×). 069E=墓 and 0763=餌 fixed by script context (fontmatch said 薑, 館).
